  "description": "A fast and reliable, (non blocking!), .NET File/Directory watcher, complete rewrite of FileSystemWatcher to ensure speed/accuracy/reliability/suppress duplicate events\n\nSupported platforms:\n- .NET Framework 4.6.2+\n- .NET Standard 2.0+\n- .NET 8.0+",
